1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:02,020
Lady Toki.

2
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:05,277
I received news of Lord Odin's demise.

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:07,860
They say he died a heroic death.

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:21,820
Toki, I see the end coming.

5
00:00:24,260 --> 00:00:29,277
if i fail to defeat kaido it will
be a long time before a challenger

6
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:34,317
as strong as i appears and if hope
does arrive it will come in 20

7
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:39,557
years i believe a massive war will
erupt frightful enough to split

8
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:46,140
the seas in the midst of that
conflict powerful figures will fight

9
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:50,797
their way into the new world,
riding the waves of freedom.

10
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,560
They will be the ones to defeat Kaido.

11
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:58,377
A long winter is coming
to the land of Wano.

12
00:00:58,460 --> 00:01:01,820
Toki, if I am to die in this struggle,

13
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:05,120
I want you to use your power.

14
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:18,220
Take these home, Enma and Ame no Havakiri.

15
00:01:18,640 --> 00:01:21,060
I want our children to inherit them.

16
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:25,773
The children are a bit young, not to
mention small to be swinging a sword.

17
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:28,480
I was sentenced to death, you know.

18
00:01:28,740 --> 00:01:29,960
Why so nonchalant?

19
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:31,040
You won't die.

20
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,660
Not my husband.

21
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:38,100
That's my wife.

22
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:45,180
I'd be a laughingstock if
anyone saw me crying now.

23
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:47,480
I'm a Kozuki as well.

24
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,784
That will not be your weakness.

25
00:01:49,900 --> 00:01:51,960
Let us look to the future together.

26
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:55,460
Twenty years from now, we'll win.

27
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,390
get up

28
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,237
don't knowShut it up

29
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:35,997
Hey, leave that ?

30
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:38,480
More ? ? ? ? ? ?

31
00:02:39,140 --> 00:02:39,970
?

32
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:46,130
?

33
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:27,040
Dreaming Oohh! wooohhh!

34
00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:29,440
wooohhh! wooohhh!

35
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:37,160
Up you go!

36
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:40,337
That's way too high! Odin! Stop! Please!

37
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:42,077
Odin! Stop! Please!

38
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:45,760
This is how wide the world
is, even from high in the sky.

39
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:47,420
You cannot see it all.

40
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:49,640
Quite the miracle, is it not?

41
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:54,820
Take a good look at all the things
you cannot find in the land of Wano.

42
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:01,400
It's so shiny, like treasure
sparkling in the sea!

43
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,880
Treasure, you say?

44
00:04:03,300 --> 00:04:05,100
Seems you and I think alike.

45
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,137
You take after your father already?

46
00:04:07,220 --> 00:04:10,280
I shall teach you all I know, Momonosuke.

47
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,482
You must broaden your knowledge.

48
00:04:12,940 --> 00:04:14,680
Broaden your horizons!

49
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:19,500
So tell me, my boy, what
kind of women do you like?

50
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:20,900
He's too young!

51
00:04:21,960 --> 00:04:24,997
When you cut a man down,
think of him as a fish cake!

52
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:25,910
Understand?

53
00:04:25,993 --> 00:04:27,237
He's way too young!

54
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,760
Ha ha ha!

55
00:04:35,820 --> 00:04:38,380
Ah, that's beautiful, Hiyori.

56
00:04:38,700 --> 00:04:41,220
You've gotten so good at playing. Really?

57
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:43,402
The song's called Moon Princess.

58
00:04:47,820 --> 00:04:49,960
I'm going to try to get even better.

59
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:52,320
Good, keep it up.

60
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,795
You can play it at my funeral someday.

61
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,620
Hey, Momo, stop making your sister cry.

62
00:05:04,820 --> 00:05:07,140
You're the one who made her cry. Me?

63
00:05:07,620 --> 00:05:08,980
The funeral thing?

64
00:05:09,460 --> 00:05:12,240
I'm sorry, it was only a joke.

65
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:14,250
Promise?

66
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:18,760
Like I die and leave you.

67
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:22,480
Well, my lord, how was the outside world?

68
00:05:23,620 --> 00:05:26,760
Its splendors are difficult
to express with words.

69
00:05:28,040 --> 00:05:30,540
But every day was a grand adventure!

70
00:05:31,040 --> 00:05:32,860
Did you Gara happen to see Zo?

71
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,670
Yes!

72
00:05:34,753 --> 00:05:36,520
Wouldn't dare miss it! After all,

73
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:41,584
the people of Zo and the Kozuki Clan have
held a strong bond for many, many years.

74
00:05:41,920 --> 00:05:45,997
I was impressed by the strength and
loyalty of the minks that I met there.

75
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:48,668
If you're in a pinch,
Zo is the place to go!

76
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:52,058
I'm sure you can count on
them to lend a helping paw!

77
00:05:52,240 --> 00:05:54,077
What do you mean, in a pinch?

78
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:56,840
A pinch is a pinch. You'll know.

79
00:05:57,100 --> 00:06:00,377
I'm sure I can count on you
two to save the day as well.

80
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:01,989
Now I'm starting to blush.

81
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:04,417
Better make sure we don't disappoint.

82
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:05,330
Right, Cat?

83
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,400
I've come to help.

84
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:11,020
Be at ease, friends.

85
00:06:11,620 --> 00:06:13,740
I've collected your weapons for you.

86
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:15,500
We are saved.

87
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,460
You all must survive.

88
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:20,060
This country's future depends on you.

89
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:22,360
Well, we shall certainly try.

90
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,480
You have my thanks.

91
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,680
But of course, this is nothing.

92
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:29,600
Odin Castle, that's our goal!

93
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:31,150
Jakuri!

94
00:06:31,520 --> 00:06:32,350
Yeah!

95
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,560
Serf King, one wreath question.

96
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:48,456
Could I be one of the Kozuki
clan's retainers as well?

97
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:51,177
We all forced ourselves into
the position, quite honestly.

98
00:06:51,260 --> 00:06:54,860
So the choice is up to you, right

99
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:02,800
Look here they are the samurai

100
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:23,480
We're not done!

101
00:07:24,200 --> 00:07:25,030
What?!

102
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:29,140
Why don't Yugara want
me to fight the enemy?

103
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:31,557
Perhaps Yugara are a spy!

104
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:33,346
Kaido said he might have one!

105
00:07:33,780 --> 00:07:34,610
Nonsense!

106
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:38,580
You, Gaara, taunted Kaido
and brought this upon us!

107
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:41,757
Lord Odin might still be
alive if not for your errands!

108
00:07:41,840 --> 00:07:43,300
That's a damn lie!

109
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:49,037
We're going to so with or without you!

110
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:53,620
They'll die before they get there
After you gotta stab them in the back

111
00:07:58,460 --> 00:08:02,580
Stop that at once Both of
you Now is not the time

112
00:08:04,540 --> 00:08:07,760
Dogstorm, Cat Viper Damn it, what now?

113
00:08:11,860 --> 00:08:13,320
What is that thing?

114
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:17,560
I fear we cannot aid them We must
escape There are too many of them

115
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:21,140
Let's thin them out. You ready? Of course.

116
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,310
Digital!

117
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,150
Ashura!

118
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:34,860
I'll go and back them up.

119
00:08:35,060 --> 00:08:36,200
Run away!

120
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,280
To Olin' Castle!

121
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:48,700
Fire the arrows.

122
00:08:49,700 --> 00:08:51,340
Mother, I'm scared.

123
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:54,280
Don't worry.

124
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:56,837
I'll make certain both of you escape.

125
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:57,750
Just hold on.

126
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,540
I know what to do.

127
00:09:15,180 --> 00:09:16,340
Mother, no!

128
00:09:29,180 --> 00:09:31,940
Mother, wake up!

129
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,560
Please, wake up!

130
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:39,000
What's your name?

131
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:46,140
It's too late!

132
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,680
I'm scared!

133
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:49,660
Someone help me!

134
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:51,880
I don't want to die!

135
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:56,180
Your father was a fool of a lord.

136
00:09:57,980 --> 00:10:01,280
Your death will mark the
end of the Kozuki clan.

137
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,360
You're wrong!

138
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,680
Your father's a great man, Momonosuke.

139
00:10:08,900 --> 00:10:13,300
And one day, my father was,

140
00:10:13,560 --> 00:10:16,817
he was a great samurai, and one day,

141
00:10:16,900 --> 00:10:21,660
the Kozuki clan shall rule
this country once more,

142
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:24,680
and I will be the Shogun.

143
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:38,117
Shallow words and likely
not your own A dream stuffed

144
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:41,760
in your head I didn't know
that you were so young

145
00:10:45,780 --> 00:10:48,120
Father, somebody help

146
00:10:56,640 --> 00:10:58,220
I've lost interest.

147
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:10,960
To think that's Odin's son.

148
00:11:11,420 --> 00:11:14,480
Let him burn to ash,
along with the castle.

149
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:27,457
It is with heavy heart
I must relay this news.

150
00:11:27,540 --> 00:11:30,800
Despite our greatest
efforts, Lord Odin was slain.

151
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:33,620
Lift your heads. Let's leave.

152
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:35,080
It's dangerous here.

153
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:36,241
There's no time.

154
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:39,360
No, I shall remain behind.

155
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:41,850
Reconsider!

156
00:11:41,933 --> 00:11:44,117
Please, it's not too
late to flee, Lady Toki.

157
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:48,740
Lady Toki, it is our honor to protect
you as long as we draw a breath.

158
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:49,960
I beg you!

159
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:52,517
Leave to the future.

160
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:53,580
Live on.

161
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:55,460
The what?

162
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,540
Who was that?

163
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:11,782
Shoot him down!

164
00:12:25,580 --> 00:12:29,220
Toki, I know why you came
here from 800 years ago.

165
00:12:29,500 --> 00:12:31,537
You wanted to witness it for yourself.

166
00:12:31,620 --> 00:12:33,740
The whole world turning upside down.

167
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:37,947
And you should jump 20
years into the future.

168
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:39,660
The day you see...

169
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:42,300
No dinner for you today.

170
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,620
What a pity.

171
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:49,100
Oh, well, that's only fair
since I'm not making any money.

172
00:12:49,540 --> 00:12:50,860
That's not why.

173
00:12:52,180 --> 00:12:53,180
Then what?

174
00:12:53,380 --> 00:12:54,380
Just tell me.

175
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:56,541
Because you said something awful.

176
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,400
It's scary, like something's wrong.

177
00:13:05,820 --> 00:13:07,761
What's this bad feeling, Grandma?

178
00:13:08,060 --> 00:13:09,540
This is the end.

179
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:12,597
We turned our back on Lord Odin.

180
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:16,180
and now the gods have
turned their backs on us.

181
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:25,980
It's just the beginning of an endless
night for all of Wano and its people.

182
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:34,260
Odin, I came here because I
was running from the past.

183
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:38,520
I always believed if I came to the future,

184
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,437
there would be someone waiting.

185
00:13:40,520 --> 00:13:44,380
someone who could make a difference.

186
00:13:49,740 --> 00:13:51,300
It's Lady Toki.

187
00:13:54,620 --> 00:13:57,360
You are the moon, yet unaware

188
00:13:58,260 --> 00:13:59,090
of the dawn.

189
00:13:59,173 --> 00:14:00,940
May your purpose be fulfilled.

190
00:14:08,900 --> 00:14:14,700
and cast nine shadows on
the night woven of 20 years,

191
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:19,040
and you shall know the
brilliance of the dawn.

192
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:21,380
Remember this, please.

193
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:43,330
Odin.

194
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:54,520
I wanted this water boiling hot.

195
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:57,612
It's as hot as it gets, I can assure you.

196
00:14:58,500 --> 00:15:00,020
Don't you lie to me.

197
00:15:00,940 --> 00:15:02,360
It's freezing! Freezing!

198
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:03,710
Freezing!

199
00:15:04,780 --> 00:15:06,020
Oh, hot!

200
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:09,280
Look at my hand!

201
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:10,774
The water is scalding!

202
00:15:10,960 --> 00:15:12,725
You're going to cook yourself!

203
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:17,020
I'm shivering cold!

204
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:18,700
I can't stop shaking!

205
00:15:19,700 --> 00:15:21,780
I want the hands of those samurai!

206
00:15:22,220 --> 00:15:23,420
I want their bones!

207
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,377
What's taking so long?!

208
00:15:25,460 --> 00:15:28,220
I can't rest till I know they're dead!

209
00:15:34,420 --> 00:15:41,060
All 20 years, Lady Toki, I
don't know who's alive or dead.

210
00:15:45,280 --> 00:15:47,960
Princess, behold, the ka-pa dance.

211
00:16:03,620 --> 00:16:05,020
No!

212
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,280
Hold it, pal.

213
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,957
What's with those clothes?

214
00:16:43,040 --> 00:16:45,380
A bunch of filthy rags. I wonder.

215
00:16:45,620 --> 00:16:47,914
Do you really live here in the capital?

216
00:16:59,580 --> 00:17:01,740
Excuse me. We're sorry!

217
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:03,420
You're strong as hell!

218
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:05,017
Where did you come from?

219
00:17:05,100 --> 00:17:06,688
Let us work underneath you!

220
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:08,320
What's your name, man?

221
00:17:17,280 --> 00:17:18,480
My name...

222
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:20,140
Well, let's see.

223
00:17:22,460 --> 00:17:23,620
Kyoshiro will do.

224
00:17:39,540 --> 00:17:41,320
You're the Kyoshiro family?

225
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:42,680
Yes, sir.

226
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:45,128
You may lift your head now.

227
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:51,000
Your reputation is impeccable.

228
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:52,481
What do you say?

229
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,409
Want to serve as my guard?

230
00:17:54,820 --> 00:17:56,467
Why, that would be an honor.

231
00:17:56,820 --> 00:17:58,060
My lord.

232
00:17:59,040 --> 00:17:59,937
Very good.

233
00:18:00,020 --> 00:18:01,240
Very good.

234
00:18:01,600 --> 00:18:03,860
All is yours. Gold. Women.

235
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:05,270
Gods.

236
00:18:05,520 --> 00:18:08,520
I so gladly provide everything
that you may desire.

237
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:10,380
Did you hear that?

238
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:11,800
I love this guy.

239
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:16,560
Where'd he come from?

240
00:18:16,880 --> 00:18:18,409
Seems too good to be true.

241
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:21,320
He's a wealthy businessman,
and he's strong.

242
00:18:21,620 --> 00:18:22,660
He's a yakuza.

243
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,820
He's taking boss Yoguro's place.

244
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:28,637
The Kyoshiro family
rules the flower capital.

245
00:18:28,720 --> 00:18:30,560
He has a weakness, though.

246
00:18:30,940 --> 00:18:33,116
Because he always looks tired, right?

247
00:18:33,240 --> 00:18:35,828
That's why people call
him Napping Kyoshiro.

248
00:18:36,020 --> 00:18:37,800
Too much nightlife is my bet.

249
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:50,080
Mitsushimin Shukazo!

250
00:18:50,460 --> 00:18:52,872
He stole money from the storehouse again!

251
00:19:02,980 --> 00:19:03,810
Princess!

252
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:05,040
Lady Hiyori!

253
00:19:05,320 --> 00:19:06,560
Where did you go?

254
00:19:06,820 --> 00:19:08,620
Please don't leave me!

255
00:19:13,720 --> 00:19:15,100
Excuse me, boss.

256
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:21,057
We found this cute little
girl on the street.

257
00:19:21,140 --> 00:19:22,787
She acted like she was lost.

258
00:19:22,900 --> 00:19:23,959
Must be an orphan.

259
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,798
She's practically starving to death.

260
00:19:29,220 --> 00:19:34,680
This may be hard to understand.
What? Denchiro? Really?

261
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:36,990
None other.

262
00:19:37,073 --> 00:19:38,260
What a relief.

263
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:41,570
Denchiro.

264
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:45,860
Gaze upon my face.

265
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:50,289
Haunted by the Ghost of Wrath,
it's twisted into this shape.

266
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:53,680
Even Kin'emon and the others
would not recognize me.

267
00:19:54,140 --> 00:19:55,940
And that is our strength.

268
00:19:57,060 --> 00:20:01,160
This shall be our secret, held
till the day of the final battle.

269
